The '''Kijimi system''' was a [[star system]]<ref name="Outlaws" /> in the [[Bryx sector]] of the [[Mid Rim Territories|Mid Rim]]<ref name="TROS VD" /> that contained the [[Temperature|frigid]] [[planet]] [[Kijimi]]. The system also contained the [[Kijimi Nebula]].<ref name="Outlaws" />

